{"id": "17-488-2-2", "zh": "原形连声法", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-489-2-9", "zh": "接下来讲述：元音在本应进行连声变化时，保持原形不变的情况。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-490-2-12", "zh": "并且“sarā（元音）”“pakatī（原形）”两词从前文延续适用。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-491-2-7", "zh": "35. Sare kvaci（后接元音时，有时保持原形）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-492-2-17", "zh": "意思是：元音在后接元音时，有时——在一旦变化就会破坏格律或难以发音的地方，以及无意连声的地方——保持原形，不发生省略、替换或变化。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-493-2-15", "zh": "其中，所谓保持原形之处，是指：不在 iti 之前、也不是为了维护格律时的呼格词尾；非复合词中的词尾长元音；名词词尾、过去时动词等处的 i 与 u；诸如此类。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-494-2-51", "zh": "先说呼格词尾：在 katamā cānanda aniccasaññā、katamā cānanda ādīnavasaññā、sāriputta idhekacco、ehi sivika uṭṭhehi、upāsakā idhekacco、bhoti ayye、bhikkhu arogaṃ tava sīlaṃ、siñca bhikkhu imaṃ nāvaṃ、bhikkhave evaṃ vadāmi、pañcime gahapatayo ānisaṃsā 等例子中保持原形，不发生前元音省略、y 与 v 的替换等变化。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-495-2-19", "zh": "由于本条用了 kvaci（有时）一词，在 iti 之前以及为维护格律时会发生连声，例如：sakkā devīti、namo te buddha vīratthu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-496-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**sare**（后接元音时）”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-496-6-12", "zh": "因为后接辅音时不属于本条，例如：sādhu mahārājāti、evaṃ kira bhikkhūti。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-497-2-95", "zh": "非复合词中的词尾长元音：āyasmā ānando gāthā ajjhabhāsi、devā ābhassarā yathā、tevijjā iddhippattā ca、bhagavā uṭṭhāyāsanā、bhagavā etadavoca、abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ aṭṭhāsi、gantvā olokento、bhūtavādī atthavādī、yaṃ itthī arahā assa、sāmāvatī āha、pāpakārī ubhayattha tappati、nadī ottharati、ye te bhikkhū appicchā、bhikkhū āmantesi、bhikkhūujjhāyiṃsu、bhikkhū evamāhaṃsu、imasmiṃ gāme ārakkhakā、sabbe ime、katame ekādasa、gambhīre odakantike、appamādo amatapadaṃ、saṅgho āgacchatu、ko imaṃ pathaviṃ viccessati、āloko udapādi、eko ekāya、cattāro oghā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-498-2-31", "zh": "不变词中也是如此：are ahampi、sace imassa kāyassa、no abhikkamo、aho acchariyo、atho anto ca、atha kho āyasmā、atho oṭṭhavacittakā、tato āmantayī satthā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-499-2-8", "zh": "由于用了 kvaci（有时）一词，在 a 音以及 iti、iva、eva、ettha 等处也会发生连声。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-499-9-47", "zh": "例如：āgatattha、āgatamhā、katamāssu cattāro、appassutāyaṃ puriso、itthīti、ca marīva、sabbeva、sveva、eseva nayo、parisuddhetthāyasmanto、nettha、taṃ kutettha labbhā、sacesa brāhmaṇa、tathūpamaṃ、yathāha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-500-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**asamāse**（非复合词中）”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-500-6-15", "zh": "因为在复合词中会发生连声，例如：jivhāyatanaṃ、avijjogho、itthindriyaṃ、abhibhāyatanaṃ、bhayatupaṭṭhānaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-500-16-20", "zh": "为什么说“**acchandānurakkhaṇe**（不是为了维护格律时）”？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-500-21-28", "zh": "因为为了维护格律时会发生连声，例如：saddhīdha vittaṃ purisassa seṭṭhaṃ、yo missaro。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-501-2-12", "zh": "名词词尾的 i 与 u：gāthāhi ajjhabhāsi、pupphāni āhariṃsu、satthu adāsi。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-502-2-5", "zh": "为什么说“**kvacī**（有时）”？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-502-6-7", "zh": "因为也有发生连声的情况，例如：manasākāsi。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-503-2-8", "zh": "36. Sarā pakati byañjane（元音在辅音前保持原形）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-504-2-11", "zh": "元音在后接辅音时保持原形，意思是：大多不发生变长、变短、省略等变化。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-504-12-37", "zh": "例如：accayo、paccayo、bhāsati vā karoti vā、vedanākkhandho、bhāgyavā、bhadro kasāmiva、dīyati、tuṇhībhūto、so dhammaṃ deseti。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-505-2-5", "zh": "原形连声法到此结束。", "confidence": 85}
